flowchart LR
 subgraph REQ["1. Organiser and Coordinator"]
 direction TB
 S([Sign in]) --> D[Save Draft and Sessions]
 D --> V{Valid submission?}
 V -->|No: correct named field| D
 V -->|Yes| R[Assign Coordinator and review]
 R --> Q{Decision?}
 Q -->|Clarify| A[Organiser answers]
 A --> R
 Q -->|Reject| X([Rejected])
 Q -->|Approve| P[Ready for planning]
 end
 subgraph ARR["2. Staff and Safety Officer"]
 direction TB
 B[Arrange Session venues and equipment<br/>Assign Event technical staff] --> C{Required arrangements ready?}
 C -->|No| B
 C -->|Yes: initial Coordinator submit| SAF[Safety Officer reviews]
 SAF --> DEC{Approved?}
 DEC -->|Changes or refusal| B
 DEC -->|Yes| F[Confirmed and published]
 end
 subgraph RUN["3. Attendee and Coordinator"]
 direction TB
 REG[Register and select Sessions<br/>Capacity overflow: Pending review or waitlist] --> COMP[Complete started Event manually<br/>or evaluate passed end time]
 COMP --> ATT([Record attendance])
 REG --> CAN[Cancel with reason and release resources]
 CAN --> CX([Cancelled])
 end
 REQ -->|Approved Event| ARR
 ARR -->|Published confirmed Event| RUN
